<DATA_WEAPON_BONUS>
<BonusMalus id="DWARF-WEAPB01">
<Description language="ENGLISH">"Salvo"</Description>
<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"A Salvo weapon can be fired a number of times equal to its Rating before it needs to be reloaded. When shooting a Salvo weapon, you can choose to fire a single shot (reducing Salvo by 1), or a batch of missiles (reducing Salvo by the number of shots fired). Each missile fired after the first suffers a cumulative -10 on its Ranged Test. The Reload Rating of a Salvo weapon indicates the SLs required to increase its Salvo by 1. If a Dwarf Salvo weapon Misfires on a roll of 00, the crew suffers a number of hits equal to the weapon&apos;s remaining Salvo Rating (minimum 1)."</Explanation>
<Short language="ENGLISH">"fire several missiles per Reload"</Short>
<Modifier>"+"</Modifier>
</BonusMalus>
</DATA_WEAPON_BONUS>
